<view class="container">
  <view class="card bg-info">
    <view class="level-info">核对一下再出结论</view>
    <view class="muted small">小字号的数字容易看错一位，差一个零结论就反了。有不对的直接改。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{notes.length}}">
    <view class="card-title">识别时遇到的情况</view>
    <view class="muted small" wx:for="{{notes}}" wx:key="*this">· {{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">基本信息</view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="muted">商品名称</text>
      <input value="{{productName}}" data-field="productName" bindinput="onField" placeholder="可不填" style="text-align:right;flex:1;margin-left:24rpx;"/>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="muted">SC 号</text>
      <input value="{{scCode}}" data-field="scCode" bindinput="onField" placeholder="如 SC1061..." style="text-align:right;flex:1;margin-left:24rpx;"/>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="muted">执行标准</text>
      <input value="{{standard}}" data-field="standard" bindinput="onField" placeholder="如 GB/T 20977" style="text-align:right;flex:1;margin-left:24rpx;"/>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">营养成分表的基准</view>
    <view class="muted small">这一项抄错，所有数值都会算错</view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{basisOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{basisIndex}}" bindchange="onBasisChange">
      <view class="row"><text>基准</text><text class="level-info">{{basisOptions[basisIndex].label}} ›</text></view>
    </picker>
    <view class="row" wx:if="{{isServing}}">
      <text class="muted">每份重量</text>
      <input type="digit" value="{{servingSize}}" data-field="servingSize" bindinput="onField" placeholder="必填" style="text-align:right;flex:1;margin-left:24rpx;"/>
      <text class="muted">{{servingUnit}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">营养成分</view>
    <view class="muted small">没印在包装上的留空，留空表示「未知」，不会被当成 0</view>
    <view class="row" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="key">
      <text class="muted">{{item.label}}</text>
      <input type="digit" value="{{item.value}}" data-idx="{{index}}" bindinput="onNutrient" placeholder="—" style="text-align:right;flex:1;margin-left:24rpx;"/>
      <text class="muted" style="width:70rpx;text-align:right;">{{item.unit}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">配料表</view>
    <textarea value="{{ingredientsText}}" data-field="ingredientsText" bindinput="onField"
              placeholder="各成分以顿号分隔" auto-height
              style="width:100%;min-height:120rpx;font-size:28rpx;"/>
  </view>

  <view class="card bg-warn" wx:if="{{error}}"><text class="level-warn">{{error}}</text></view>

  <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{submitting}}">
    {{submitting ? '分析中…' : '确认无误，出结论'}}
  </button>
</view>
